href=\"/wiki/J%C3%B6nk%C3%B6pings_S%C3%B6dra_IF\" title=\"Jönköpings Södra IF\">Jönköpings Södra IF</a></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;background-color:#f0f1f2;\">Statistik</th></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Spelade&#160;matcher</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">240</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Totalt&#160;antal&#160;mål</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">673 (2,8 per match)</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Bästa målgörare</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jesper_Westermark\" title=\"Jesper Westermark\">Jesper Westermark</a> (17 mål)<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Stats&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Stats-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;hemmavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Utsiktens_BK\" title=\"Utsiktens BK\">Utsikten</a> 5–0 <a href=\"/wiki/GIF_Sundsvall\" title=\"GIF Sundsvall\">Sundsvall</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(10 juni 2023)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;bortavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"border:none;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;background-color:transparent;color:inherit;text-align:center;\">2 matcher</div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\" style=\"font-weight:normal;background-color:transparent;color:inherit;text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gefle_IF_Fotboll\" title=\"Gefle IF Fotboll\">Gefle</a> 0–6 <a href=\"/wiki/Gais\" title=\"Gais\">Gais</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(23 september 2023)</span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Trelleborgs_FF\" title=\"Trelleborgs FF\">Trelleborg</a> 0–6 <a href=\"/wiki/Gais\" title=\"Gais\">Gais</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(8 oktober 2023)</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Målrikaste match</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rebro_SK_Fotboll\" title=\"Örebro SK Fotboll\">Örebro</a> 5–3 <a href=\"/wiki/Sk%C3%B6vde_AIK\" title=\"Skövde AIK\">Skövde</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(18 september 2023)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Totalt åskådarantal</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">624&#160;395<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-publik&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-publik-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Åskådarantal i snitt</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">2&#160;602<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-publik&#95;2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-publik-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"\"><div style=\"float: left;\">&#8592; <a href=\"/wiki/Superettan_2022\" title=\"Superettan 2022\">2022</a> </div><div style=\"float: right;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Superettan_2024\" title=\"Superettan 2024\">2024</a> &#8594;</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div style=\"float:right;clear:right;width:354px;padding:4px;border:1px solid silver;margin:4px;background-color:white\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;border:1px solid silver;padding:0px;width:350px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fil:Map_of_Sweden_(polar_stereographic).svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/56/Map_of_Sweden_%28polar_stereographic%29.svg/500