"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-nominerade&#95;21-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-nominerade-21\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>21<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fil:Axel_henriksson_gais_(crop).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/Axel_henriksson_gais_%28crop%29.jpg/250px-Axel_henriksson_gais_%28crop%29.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"190\" height=\"299\" style=\"--mw-file-upright: 0.75\" class=\"mw-file-element mw-file-upright\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/Axel_henriksson_gais_%28crop%29.jpg/500px-Axel_henriksson_gais_%28crop%29.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"710\" data-file-height=\"1118\" /></a><figcaption>Gais Axel Henriksson utsågs till årets unga spelare i Superettan 2023.</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li><b>Årets målvakt:</b> <a href=\"/wiki/Anton_Fagerstr%C3%B6m\" title=\"Anton Fagerström\">Anton Fagerström</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/V%C3%A4ster%C3%A5s_SK_Fotboll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Västerås SK Fotboll\">Västerås SK</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>Övriga nominerade:</i> <a href=\"/wiki/Mergim_Krasniqi\" title=\"Mergim Krasniqi\">Mergim Krasniqi</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Gais\" title=\"Gais\">Gais</a>; <a href=\"/wiki/Elias_Hadaya\" title=\"Elias Hadaya\">Elias Hadaya</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Utsiktens_BK\" title=\"Utsiktens BK\">Utsiktens BK</a></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><b>Årets back:</b> <a href=\"/wiki/Fr%C3%A9d%C3%A9ric_Nsabiyumva\" title=\"Frédéric Nsabiyumva\">Frédéric Nsabiyumva</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/V%C3%A4ster%C3%A5s_SK_Fotboll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Västerås SK Fotboll\">Västerås SK</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>Övriga nominerade:</i> <a href=\"/wiki/Axel_Nor%C3%A9n\" title=\"Axel Norén\">Axel Norén</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Gais\" title=\"Gais\">Gais</a>; <a href=\"/wiki/August_W%C3%A4ngberg\" title=\"August Wängberg\">Augu